<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX Dec gold - unchanged to down $0.50</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - unchanged to down 0.5 cent</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - unchanged to down $1.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - down $1.00 to $2.00</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - down 0.5 to 1.0 cent a lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
